    "detailed_description": "Fallenshadow has charmed her husbands and they are now trying to catch her, fight them off in Lobby 2, a 2D top down, timed survival game. Take on the forms of 12 girls to access 70 perks and create a Shondo able to withstand her husbands love<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Custom Builds:</strong> 70 perks from 12 classes can be combined to create a custom build<br></li><li><strong>Alternative modes:</strong> Activate ribbons that change how the game is played for unique runs<br></li><li><strong>Fast sessions:</strong> 20 minute timed mode and endless mode<br></li><li><strong>Persistent progress:</strong> Unlock upgrades that carry over across runs<br></li><li><strong>Stream references:</strong> Every perk refers back to memorable stream moments<br></li><li><strong>Easy Controls:</strong> Directional aim and automatic firing makes playing easy</li></ul>",
